     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The previous link shows how to use &quot;inspect element&quot;, from chrome or firefox, to figure out the styles you need to change.<div><br></div><div>Another way to include your own styles is to create your own css file and read it with  includeCSS. </div><div><br></div><div>And another approach, pointed out by Stéphane, is to inline in ui.R with tags$style.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
